  m_text: 'The Individual-Agency View: The responsibility lies with The Individual
    User. At a certain age, individuals must take agency over their own habits. Externalizing
    blame to ''algorithms'' or ''parents'' ignores personal autonomy and the necessity
    of self-regulation in a free society.'
